# image-size 2.0.2 — infinite-loop DoS in the ICNS (CVE-2025-71330) and
# JXL/HEIF (CVE-2025-71329) parsers when fed a crafted image buffer.
# No patched release exists (2.0.2 IS the latest published version, no
# fix upstream as of 2026-08-11). Reaches the prod graph only via
# @nuxtjs/seo -> nuxt-seo-utils, which runs image-size on the site's
# own static/OG images, not on user-supplied buffers, so the DoS is not
# attacker-reachable here. Remove both entries as soon as image-size
# publishes a fixed version and nuxt-seo-utils picks it up.
CVE-2025-71329
CVE-2025-71330
